the guy was barely coherent when they pulled him in, babbling pure nonsense. We figured it wasn't worth sending a team out over an unconfirmed rumor.",0,""],["w",0.8],["ctl","avg3_159","a","005","awkward",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_161","a","004",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou2","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_161","But what if he did see something?",0,""],["ctl","avg3_161","a","006","exclamation",0.4,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["say","avg3_161","If there's an uncharted Monolith out there, we need to put it on the map. Rumor or not, I have to see it for myself.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_159","a","003","sigh",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_159","I figured you'd say that. Officially, I can't assign you people or resources. But if you want to poke around on your own time, I'm not stopping you.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_161","a",null,null,0.35,null,null,0.0,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["bgm",""],["ctl","avg3_159","a",null,"speechless",0.5,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_159","One thing though, Leafia...==W== Have you ever sailed the open ocean?",0,""],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg3_159","a","004","question",null,-0.45,1.6,null,null,"OutCubic",0.3],["goon"],["ctl","avg3_161","a","011",null,0.5,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.0],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_159","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["bg","mood_2",0,0.5],["ctl","avg3_161","a","011","music",0.5,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg3_161","Nope.",0,""],["w",0.5],["bgm","m4"],["bg","travellers_home_inside",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_161","a","010","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"JuGong1","Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg3_161","That means you have to help me figure it out.",0,""],["ctl","avg3_159","a",null,null,0.7,0.0,1.0,null,null,"Linear",0.0],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_161","a",null,null,0.35,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["ctl","avg3_159","a","005","sweaty",0.65,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_159","You always ask for favors like you're owed them.==W== Fine, I can't talk. Lucky for you, I saw this coming.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_161","a","002",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.505],["ctl","avg3_159","a","003","happy",null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_161","a",null,null,0.3,null,null,0.0,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["ctl","avg3_159","a","007","idea",0.5,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["say","avg3_159","I'll hook you up with two experts. If you want to get out on the water, they're your best bet.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_159","a","004","attention",null,-0.35,1.5,null,"jushou2","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_159","Oh, and when you see them,==W== see if you can ask when they'll finally drop by. My special expert seats are gathering dust over here...",0,""],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["bg","mood_3",0,0.5],["ctl","avg3_159","a","005","vexation",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["bg","sky_sunny",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["stg",0,100.0,null,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["se","se_431"],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_sunlight",0,0],["cbg",0,null,90.0,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["bg","ttc_harbour_2_daylight",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["show","avg3_161","a","003",0.3,null,null,0,null,0.0],["se","se_062"],["ctl","avg3_161","a",null,null,0.35,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_161","This should be the spot.==W== Horizon mentioned Fluflas in swimsuits... Ah, there they are!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_161","a","002","speechless",0.5,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_161","a","004","attention",0.45,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["say","avg3_161","Ah, there!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_161","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["stg",0,-100.0,null,1.0,"Linear",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_161","a",null,null,0.2,null,null,null,null,"