thing even more important.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_161","a","004","question",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_161","Something more important? Is it...==W== I've heard fishermen offer a prayer to the sea before heading out...",0,""],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg3_161","a","015","idea",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_157","b","009","sweaty",null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_157","Not our thing.==W== Priority number one is getting you a swimsuit!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_157","b","014","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"jushou2","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_161","a","013","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",1.5],["se","se_146"],["ctl","avg3_161","a","017",null,null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_161","Huh? Did I hear that right? Maybe I need more sleep.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_155","b","002",null,null,null,null,null,"xuanyun","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_155","You heard right! Let's go, we need to get you a swimsuit!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_161","a","009","flurry",null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_161","B-But aren't we here to investigate the sea Monolith? What's a swimsuit got to do with that?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_161","a",null,null,0.4,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["ctl","avg1_155","b",null,null,0.7,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.505],["ctl","avg1_157","b","013","exclamation",0.2,null,null,null,"jushou2","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_157","A lot! You can't seriously plan to go out in those clothes. If they get wet, not only will you be miserable, you'll barely be able to move!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_155","b","006","music",null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_155","A swimsuit is essential gear! Light, breathable, nothing to hold you back.==W== And the best part? Put on the right one, and you'll feel like diving right into the ocean!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_1